-Preparation leaves the session and its descendants untouched. Apply validates parent and
-training-data identity. `unchanged` keeps the logical predecessor and removes the requested
-stage and its descendants. Compact deltas can only be restored against their matching parent;
-they are separate from ordinary inference exports and resumable training checkpoints.
-
-Banding's six default positive budget fractions are 1/32, 1/16, 1/8, 1/4, 1/2 and 1.
